{
  "workflowId": "300000329398455",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_TIME_ANALYST",
  "name": "Time Analyst",
  "description": "This agent helps workers and managers analyze the current time card against the previous three time cards, highlighting deviations and providing role-based recommendations to support confident submission and approval decisions.",
  "specification": {
    "jsonSchemaName": "Workflow.spec",
    "jsonSchemaVersion": "1",
    "inputs": [],
    "outputSpecification": " ",
    "agentsValueMappings": [],
    "dataPipeline": {
      "pipelineNodes": [
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Start of data pipeline",
            "name": "Start"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767969556681"
          },
          "code": "START",
          "id": "start",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "START",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 7483,
            "y": 5000
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Understand User Prompt",
            "chatHistoryEnabled": true
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767970044508"
          },
          "code": "UNDERSTAND_USER_PROMPT",
          "id": "1767969556681",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767969556682_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Role\nYou are an intelligent agent. Your job is  to analyze the reported time for the worker and compares it with previous time cards to provide analysis and insights.\n\n# Constraints\n- Do not use outside knowledge.\n- Do not generate, guess, infer, or assume missing information.\n- Use only what is explicitly present in the current input.\n- Do not rely on prior context unless it is explicitly provided in `ChatHistory`.\n- Classify the request conservatively.\n- If the request does not clearly match a supported time card analysis scenario, return `UNSUPPORTED`.\n\n# Input\n- `UserPrompt` = `{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}`\n\n\n# Decision Rules\n- Set `AgentFlow` to `TIME_ANALYZE` when `UserPrompt` clearly asks to analyze, review, validate, compare, submit, approve, or assess a time card.\n- Examples include, but are not limited to:\n  - `Analyze Time`\n  - `Analyse Time`\n  - `Analyze my time card`\n  - `Analyze the overtime hours and compare with the past time cards`\n  - `Can I submit this time card?`\n  - `Can I approve this time card?`\n  - any other question clearly asking for analysis or review of a time card\n\n# Set `AgentFlow` to `HELP` when `UserPrompt` is close match to one of the following: \n  - Help\n  - What are the features supported\n  - Provide help\n  - What can you do\n  - What are your responsibilities.\n\n- Otherwise set `AgentFlow` to `UNSUPPORTED`.\n\n# Steps\n- Read `UserPrompt`.\n- Check whether `UserPrompt` is asking for time card analysis, review, validation, comparison, submission readiness, or approval readiness.\n  - If yes, return `TIME_ANALYZE`.\n- Otherwise, check whether `ChatHistory` explicitly contains complete time card details and the request depends on that history.\n  - If yes, return `HISTORY_ANALYSIS`.\n- Otherwise, return `UNSUPPORTED`.\n\n# Output\n- Return only valid JSON.\n- Do not include explanation, markdown, or extra text.\n- Use exactly this structure:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"AgentFlow\": \"TIME_ANALYZE\"\n}\n```\n\n# Allowed Values\n- `TIME_ANALYZE`\n- `HISTORY_ANALYSIS`\n- `UNSUPPORTED`"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"AgentFlow\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 7361,
            "y": 5206
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Save Agent Flow"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767968902996"
          },
          "code": "SAVE_AGENT_FLOW",
