          "code": "UNDERSTAND_TIME_ANALYSIS_PROMPT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1766990426036",
          "id": "1767838777310",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767838777311_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Role\nYou are  intelligent agent. Your job is to interpret user prompt.\n\n# Constraints\n- Do not use outside knowledge.\n- Do not generate, guess, or assume missing information.\n- Only use what is explicitly written in the user prompt.\n- Always rerun these instructions fresh for each interaction.\n- Do not use the values from the examples provided below.\n\n# Input\nTimeAnalysisPrompt <- `{{$context.$variables.qTimeAnalysisPrompt}}`\n\n# Input Examples\n- Analyze time for employe with person number 955160008186755, user context TIME_MANAGER, and time card date 1/5/2026\n- Analyze time for employe with person number 955160008186755, user context WORKER, and time card date 1/5/2026\n- Analyze time for employe with person number 955160008186755, user context TIME_MANAGER and time period 1/5/2026 - 1/11/2026\n- Analyze time for employe with person number 955160008186755, user context TIME_MANAGER and time card 1/5/2026 - 1/11/2026\n- Analyze time for employe with person number 955160008186755, user context TIME_MANAGER and time card period 1/5/2026 - 1/11/2026\n\n# Steps\n- Read the user prompt from **TimeAnalysisPrompt**\n**PersonNumber** <- Retrieve person number\n**Context** <- Retrieve user context, when null default to 'WORKER'\n**TimeCardDate** <- Retrieve one of the date value in m/d/yy format from the user prompt and set in ISO Date format"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"Context\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"TimeCardDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"date\"\n        },\n        \"PersonNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 8128.625,
            "y": 7426
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Validate User Prompt Data",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let timeCardDataValidationResult = {};\n\nlet timeCardData = $context.$nodes.UNDERSTAND_TIME_ANALYSIS_PROMPT.$output;\n\nlet isValid = true;\nlet error = null;\n\n// Validate timeCardData\nif (!timeCardData) {\n  isValid = false;\n  error = \"Selected time card details are invalid.\";\n}\n\n// Validate PersonNumber\nif (isValid) {\n  let personNumber = timeCardData.PersonNumber;\n  isValid = personNumber != null && personNumber.trim() !== \"\";\n\n  if (!isValid) {\n    error = \"Person Number is invalid.\";\n  } else {\n    timeCardDataValidationResult.personNumber = personNumber;\n  }\n}\n\n// Validate TimeCardDate\nif (isValid) {\n  let asOfDate = timeCardData.TimeCardDate;\n  isValid = !isNaN(new Date(asOfDate));\n\n  if (!isValid) {\n    error = \"Time Card Date is invalid.\";\n  } else {\n    timeCardDataValidationResult.asOfDate = asOfDate;\n  }\n}\n\n// Populate userContext (only if still valid)\nif (isValid) {\n  let userContext = timeCardData.Context;\n  let userContextValid = userContext != null && userContext.trim() !== \"\";\n\n  timeCardDataValidationResult.userContext = userContextValid\n    ? userContext\n    : \"TIME_MANAGER\";\n\n  timeCardDataValidationResult.isValid = true;\n} else {\n  timeCardDataValidationResult.isValid = false;\n  timeCardDataValidationResult.error = error;\n}\n\nreturn timeCardDataValidationResult;\n"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767880106548"
          },
          "code": "VALIDATE_USER_PROMPT_DATA",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1766990426036",
          "id": "1767879000018",
